@33. That such as is the Knowledge and the consequent removal of evil through repentance, such is the good of charity. General article.

@108. Therefore genuine truths are to be learned; with these the good of the will conjoins itself, and thus the good of the will becomes the good of charity.

Good of Faith.; Bonum fidei.

