@8593[2]. They who are in (interior evil) do not assault the truths of faith, but the goods of faith. Explained.

@8809. Purification of the good of faith. Signified.

@9139[4]. "A noble vine" = the good of faith of that Church.

@--. The conjunction of the good of faith in the Lord, which is of the Spiritual Kingdom, with the good of love to the Lord, which is of the Celestial Kingdom. Signified.

@9230. That the falsified good of faith shall not be conjoined. Signified, Explained.

@--[2]. Everything of the Church is called the good of faith which concerns life and use from those things which the doctrine of faith of the Church teaches; in a word, which concerns willing and doing them from obedience...

