@3570[6]. Not all the things which the soul introduces are such as to become the good of life...

@3603[3]. In his fourth age, which is the age of his regeneration... the man loves the Word and the doctrinal things which are from it... for the sake of the good of life; and therefore from the good of life. Thus does good become in the first place...

