@--[8]. That the good of life, or to live well, is to shun evils because they are contrary to religion, thus contrary to God. Explained.

@AR 5. The things which are revealed by the Lord through Heaven to those who are in the good of life from charity and its faith. Signified, Explained.

@17. Truth in act and work, which is the good of life... is the first and primary of the Church. Explained. @--[4].

