@94[end]. As to life they are in goods, which they believe to be goods of life, when yet they are not.

@358. The good of life with those who will be of the Lord's New Heaven and New Church. Signified, Explained.

@--[end]. The meritorious good of life. Signified.

@461[end]. The good of life is not religion where there is faith alone.

@815. That through truths from the Word there are goods of life with those who are of the Lord's Church. Signified, Explained.

