@600[7]. "Cast the net on the right side of the vessel" = that they should teach the good of life.

@730[23]. "Wilderness" also = the state of the Church with the gentiles, who have been in ignorance of truth, and still in the good of life according to their religion, from which they have longed for truths. Explained, Illustrated.

