@835[2]. The Hell where such are appears from afar like a fiery lake with a green flame as of sulphur.

@CL 268[2]. The pupil of the eye as it were flashed in a green plain, which was from the light of phantasy. @5M 2.

@294. The inmost flowers were of a shining green.

