@750[12]. Deficiency is signified by "those who groan" (Lamentations 1:11).

@781[18]. "As doves we moan in moaning" (Isaiah 59:11) = the grief of the spiritual man.

@863[2]. "Her priests groan" (Lamentations 1:4) = that the affections of good are destroyed.

Gross.; Crassus.
Grossness.; Crassitudo. Crassamentum. Crassities.
Grossly.; Crasse.
Gross, To become.; Crassescere.

