@AC 122. To "till it and to guard it" (Genesis 2:15) = that it was conceded to him to enjoy all these things, but not to possess them as his own.

@370. "Am I my brother's keeper" (Genesis 4:9) = that it made charity of no account, and would not wait upon it.

@372. To be "a keeper" = to serve, as gate-keepers, and the house-porters in the Jewish Church.

